      "id": "claim_ad05282684a0470a9ff409d1ceb091f9",
      "statement": "The approval-gated operation list is hardcoded to submit_form, fetch_resource, and download_file; all other actions execute without an approval step. The gate is enforced in the background controller's getApprovalActionType (which returns the type only for these three) and in the MCP WebSocket client which marks exactly these three standalone tools and submit_form batch items with approvalRequest true.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/architecture/decisions/0048-client-side-action-approval.md#L41-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7f9292415c0e61282aafdd226e025827964408f87567895f7eb4e4b6280fbd53:"
        },
