      "id": "claim_84e95f1f043a4d29ac343c1dd282b479",
      "statement": "Every approval-gated operation carries a unique actionUUID and approvalRequest true in its request payload, assigned by the MCP server at envelope construction; for perform_batch every batch action carries a unique actionUUID and submit_form items additionally carry approvalRequest true. The shared protocol models these as ApprovalMetadata fields extended by all action and download/fetch request types.",
