    {
      "id": "claim_6c9b28beb8f7436e93ea01e31aa84065",
      "statement": "approve_session stores an in-memory grant keyed by origin and actionType (joined with a NUL separator) that lets future same-origin, same-action-type actions execute without a prompt for the lifetime of the current bridge connection; a different origin or action type prompts again. approve approves only the current action.",
