    {
      "id": "claim_f0c5811538e14c68b53cc24f2eccf4a6",
      "statement": "When the approval timer fires, waitForApprovalDecision calls hideApproval to dismiss the banner and resolves 'timeout', which becomes a structured approval_timeout error carrying the actionUUID; the MCP WebSocket client uses approvalTimeoutMs (not the default action timeout) as the request timeout for approval-gated single actions and approval-gated batches.",
