    {
      "id": "claim_648c5f42c9b6422191c15feaa16b1355",
      "statement": "Approval failures use dedicated error codes: approval_denied (user denied), approval_timeout (no response before approvalTimeoutMs), approval_unavailable (no adapter, no active tab, or missing actionUUID), and approval_origin_changed (active tab origin changed before execution); all may carry actionUUID and batch errors include an aborted flag.",
