    {
      "id": "claim_856567de477c46edb32b260fbcad669b",
      "statement": "When a perform_batch contains an approval-gated action, performApprovalAwareBatch runs a background-level runner that prompts one action at a time: a denied gated action returns approval_denied with aborted false and the batch continues, an approval timeout records approval_timeout with aborted true and skips remaining actions returning a partial batch_result, and an approve_session grant is reused by later gated batch actions. continueOnError still governs post-approval execution failures and page navigation still aborts remaining actions.",
