    {
      "id": "claim_577eb10bb4df41c980299211dd824a20",
      "statement": "The Chrome approval adapter injects the content script and sends a show_brijio_approval message (actionUUID, actionType, origin, timeoutMs) to the active tab; the content script renders a fixed-position banner with Approve, Approve session, and Deny buttons and responds with the decision, while hide_brijio_approval removes it. parseApprovalDecision defaults to deny for any malformed or missing response, and getActiveOrigin returns undefined for non-regular page URLs.",
